WEBVTT

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:10.012
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:13.870
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.323
Lady Neese!

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.296
Wh- What's going on?!

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.820
Now, come with me, Doorway.

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:11.448
NO!

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.995
It is your destiny.

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:26.996
NO!!

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.841
Neese!

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:34.107
This is...the dark nightmare!

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:42.751
The gods led me here...
I'm following a dark nightmare.

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:48.720
Damn it...!

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:03.134
"God of war! Give peace
to this person's heart!"

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:05.610
"Manna of all creation!

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:08.340
"Free this holy girl
from this dark covenant!"

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.765
Neese!

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:36.908
What's going on?!

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:38.444
Spark!

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:49.780
So, they used their
powers to interfere!

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:53.322
Heh... But it doesn't matter.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:57.489
| already possess
the Soul Crystal Ball.

00:04:59.532 --> 00:05:04.368
When the two keys are
gathered, we will meet again.

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:15.710
Lock the fortress gates!
Split the knights into two teams...

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.807
...and send them into the
desert to scout the area!

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:29.092
The intruder may have been a Dark
EIf looking to avenge his comrades.

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:33.755
You'd all better not move from here.
Leave the rest to us.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:36.694
Like he knows what
he's talking about...

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:40.034
No Dark Elves did this!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.576
Anyway, we'll get nothing done
just standing around here. Ryna?

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:52.777
Forget it.

00:05:53.553 --> 00:05:56.716
The one who did this
is nowhere near us.

00:05:56.789 --> 00:06:00.191
As Leaf said,
the enemy isn't a Dark EIf.

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:03.490
But I don't think they'll
attack again anytime soon.

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:06.663
So, for now...

00:06:08.301 --> 00:06:09.700
Aldo?

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:11.760
The dark nightmare...

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:14.803
That's what I heard you say.

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:18.071
Aldo, you know what's
going on here, don't you?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.314
Then tell us what it is, Aldo!

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:26.216
Why did this happen to Neese?!
Just what's going on here?!

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:28.947
No... It's just that...

00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:38.055
Aldo!

00:06:38.698 --> 00:06:42.726
All... All right.
But brace yourselves!

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:47.667
Once you all know the truth,
there's no going back!

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:51.434
Heh, what's that mean?

00:06:52.345 --> 00:06:54.313
The truthis...

00:06:57.784 --> 00:06:59.752
Wh- What did you say?!

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:03.517
The stolen crystal ball is a key to
reviving Kardis the Destroyer?!

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:05.148
Yes, that's correct.

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:08.091
Kardis is the goddess of
destruction,

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:10.630
born to destroy the entire world!

00:07:10.696 --> 00:07:13.961
If she's revived, this won't just be
like the chaos of another war!

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:18.368
All of Flaim and even Marmo will
be destroyed by that dark power!

00:07:18.438 --> 00:07:20.736
I didn't think we were
after ordinary treasure...

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:22.741
...but I never thought it was
anything as big as THIS!

00:07:22.809 --> 00:07:24.903
There's an old legend:

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:29.972
"Two keys, one door, and
Kardis shall awaken once more."

00:07:30.583 --> 00:07:32.677
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:36.052
It means when two special objects
for Kardis's advent are gathered...

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:39.217
...and a special sacrifice
is made...

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:42.728
...the goddess of
destruction shall be reborn.

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:45.856
One of the objects
is the Soul Crystal Ball...

00:07:45.932 --> 00:07:49.232
...which has the power
to resurrect the dead.

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:51.532
The other is the Staff of Life,

00:07:51.604 --> 00:07:54.437
which is able to heal
all wounds on a body.

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:58.871
And what about the special
sacrifice to revive Kardis?

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:02.280
That must be the one into whom
has been reborn the soul...

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:05.807
...of Naneel, the high
priestess of the Destroyer...

00:08:05.885 --> 00:08:08.183
...who was killed
by the Six Heroes.

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:12.691
Lady Neese's mother, Lady Leylia,
is the reincarnation of Naneel.

00:08:15.628 --> 00:08:18.757
Two keys and one door-...

00:08:18.831 --> 00:08:23.359
You're saying that's what the
dark wizard Wagnard is after?

00:08:23.436 --> 00:08:26.337
Wagnard... The dark nightmare...

00:08:28.207 --> 00:08:31.802
Hold on a minute here.
So why's he after Neese?

00:08:31.878 --> 00:08:35.473
If what you just said is true,
shouldn't he be after Leylia?

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:41.052
That's what everyone assumed
at the beginning. However...

00:08:42.255 --> 00:08:47.022
The sacrifice's blood must be
young and pure for this to work.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:52.625
When Lady Leylia gave birth to a
child, she became unsuitable for it.

00:08:54.634 --> 00:08:56.124
Also...

00:08:56.402 --> 00:09:01.067
As her only daughter, she
shares the blood of her mother.

00:09:01.741 --> 00:09:04.233
Th- Then you mean...

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.005
Yes. I am the one.

00:09:09.982 --> 00:09:12.815
I am "The Doorway".

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:17.716
Knowing this, Lady Neese
set out on her own...

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:20.521
...so that she could stop the
Destroyer from being reborn!

00:09:20.593 --> 00:09:24.029
Prepared to battle the most
merciless of dark sorcery...

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:27.862
This... This young girl who has
committed no sin of her own!

00:09:29.268 --> 00:09:31.327
It...can't be...

00:09:52.558 --> 00:09:56.426
Does hearing all this so
suddenly shock you, Master Spark?

00:09:56.495 --> 00:10:00.056
Yeah... Uh, I mean, no! I mean...

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:07.229
It's all right. I was shocked, too,
when I first learned about this.

00:10:07.306 --> 00:10:08.933
But...

00:10:09.008 --> 00:10:10.976
I... 'm sorry! For us--

00:10:11.043 --> 00:10:15.503
No, for my not getting
the Soul Crystal Ball back.

00:10:15.581 --> 00:10:17.777
Master Spark,
that wasn't your fault.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.648
Uh, look...

00:10:19.719 --> 00:10:21.619
Just call me Spark, okay?

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:28.888
Just Spark, then.
Don't torture yourself over this.

00:10:28.961 --> 00:10:31.453
This is the fate that
has been granted to me.

00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:34.498
Even if the crystal ball
hadn't been stolen...

00:10:34.567 --> 00:10:36.797
...this still would
have happened to me.

00:10:36.869 --> 00:10:40.567
B- But your enemy
is a dark wizard!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.007
You can't fight someone
like that head on!

00:10:43.075 --> 00:10:46.477
You should go some place
safe and hide, instead!

00:10:47.346 --> 00:10:50.111
You saw it yourself.
No matter where I am...

00:10:50.182 --> 00:10:54.119
...I can never be out of
Wagnard's reach. So why try?

00:10:57.256 --> 00:10:59.247
It's all right.

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:02.454
Besides, the battle
isn't decided yet.

00:11:03.829 --> 00:11:08.130
| was thinking of going to make
sure the Staff of Life was safe.

00:11:08.401 --> 00:11:10.495
The Staff of Life?!

00:11:10.569 --> 00:11:13.470
Of course! If they can't
get the other implement...

00:11:13.539 --> 00:11:16.600
...then Neese's being the
doorway wouldn't matter!

00:11:16.676 --> 00:11:20.806
| believe the Staff of Lifeis in
the temple of Falis in Valis.

00:11:22.014 --> 00:11:26.008
If it's protected by the holy
royal temple knights, then surely...

00:11:26.085 --> 00:11:27.575
Valis...

00:11:36.729 --> 00:11:40.222
HUH?! We're setting out again?!

00:11:41.767 --> 00:11:45.067
Of course we are! Now that we
know the crystal ball isn't here...

00:11:45.137 --> 00:11:47.333
...there's no point
just hanging around!

00:11:48.974 --> 00:11:50.965
Besides, there's this!

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:54.544
The dispatch from King
Kashue to King Etoh of Valis.

00:11:56.649 --> 00:11:59.812
It's the least I can
do for Neese now.

00:12:01.253 --> 00:12:03.620
All right, let's make
preparations at once!

00:12:03.689 --> 00:12:06.954
We have a vital duty to get
this dispatch to Valis!

00:12:09.395 --> 00:12:13.354
Actually, going to
Valis is a good idea.

00:12:13.432 --> 00:12:17.801
If we're lucky, we may find the
one with the crystal ball there.

00:12:18.871 --> 00:12:20.339
What do you mean?

00:12:20.406 --> 00:12:25.401
Simple. The crystal ball's already
been handed over to a courier.

00:12:26.278 --> 00:12:29.578
The fastest way for
him to get it to Marmo...

00:12:29.648 --> 00:12:34.051
...is to get a ship at the
port of Rood in Kanon.

00:12:35.454 --> 00:12:38.355
Since Kanon is still
occupied by the Marmo...

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:40.756
...that would also
be the safest way.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.652
Of course, anybody could
figure that plan out, right?

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:48.496
And, naturally, Flaim's forces
have covered the roads to Kanon.

00:12:49.368 --> 00:12:54.465
Which means a professional bag man
will take the back door out of here.

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:58.475
The only way to reach
Marmo is by the sea.

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:01.946
And if you can't use
Rood to get a ship...

00:13:02.815 --> 00:13:05.182
Of course! You'd have to go to
the port of Roid in Valis!

00:13:06.152 --> 00:13:09.315
Exactly. Excellent possibility
for us, don't you think?

00:13:09.388 --> 00:13:11.516
Heh, sharp as ever, I see.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.149
What's that supposed to mean?

00:13:14.827 --> 00:13:17.660
You're right! We still
have a chance left!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.865
Thank you. Thank you, Ryna!

00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:24.892
Please, you really
don't have to thank me.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.497
Jeez, I've never had such
a naive commander!

00:13:28.574 --> 00:13:32.306
So, that means our chief
problem is that dark wizard.

00:13:34.079 --> 00:13:37.811
He can appear
anywhere we go, right?

00:13:38.417 --> 00:13:41.387
If he targets us
while we're traveling...

00:13:41.453 --> 00:13:44.548
No, we won't have to
worry about him for a while.

00:13:47.827 --> 00:13:52.128
I've heard that, long ago,
the master wizard Ralkas...

00:13:52.198 --> 00:13:55.190
...cursed the dark wizards as
punishment for staining...

00:13:55.267 --> 00:13:58.362
...their hands with the practice of
forbidden black magic.

00:14:00.706 --> 00:14:03.539
Since then, when they use magic...

00:14:03.609 --> 00:14:07.204
...they must endure terrific
pain in their entire body.

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:13.781
But, the guy just...

00:14:13.853 --> 00:14:18.120
He cast that spell despite
the pain it caused him.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:21.888
To have that level of will
means he is no ordinary man.

00:14:22.361 --> 00:14:25.058
But for even a dark
wizard like him...

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.100
...to have performed the
spell like we saw last night...

00:14:28.167 --> 00:14:31.262
...means we won't be hearing
from him again for a while.

00:14:32.238 --> 00:14:35.401
And even if he does appear
again, when that happens...

00:14:37.209 --> 00:14:40.008
...I'll protect Neese
with my own hands!

00:14:40.079 --> 00:14:42.207
Whoa! Isn't he cool?!

00:14:42.281 --> 00:14:45.273
| won't let him sacrifice Neese
to revive the Destroyer!

00:14:45.351 --> 00:14:49.288
Especially since Neese is one
of our friends now! Right?

00:14:54.927 --> 00:14:56.395
All of you...

00:14:56.462 --> 00:14:59.727
Heh! This is one hell of a
thing to have happen!

00:14:59.798 --> 00:15:01.926
| got a bad feeling about this...

00:15:02.001 --> 00:15:04.095
...when they sent me to protect
this hot-headed captain!

00:15:04.169 --> 00:15:08.436
Oh? Are scared now because
you're facing a dark wizard,

00:15:08.507 --> 00:15:10.305
Mr. Blue Meteor?

00:15:10.376 --> 00:15:12.868
Don't be stupid!
That's not the point!

00:15:13.345 --> 00:15:15.939
| see my missions through,
no matter what!

00:15:20.953 --> 00:15:24.412
Well, now that we've decided,
give us your orders!

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:25.719
Captain!

00:15:27.459 --> 00:15:30.827
All right, everyone, let's go!
To the holy kingdom of Valis!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.397
With hope and great
trepidation mixing within him...

00:15:41.473 --> 00:15:46.070
...Spark and the others set out
for the holy kingdom of Valis.

00:15:46.145 --> 00:15:49.945
At the same time, hoping to free
Kanon from Marmo control...

00:15:50.015 --> 00:15:52.416
...Parn and Deediit were
riding to

00:15:52.484 --> 00:15:54.714
the secret base of
Kanon's free army.

00:16:03.529 --> 00:16:06.328
Come on, we're here.
That's our base.

00:16:06.398 --> 00:16:08.423
The hidden fortress
of Kanon's free army.

00:16:09.735 --> 00:16:12.227
Huh? What's...?

00:16:20.746 --> 00:16:25.274
When I heard there was a
secret army taking on the Marmo...

00:16:25.351 --> 00:16:28.480
...I expected a fortress that
looked a little more impressive.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.218
It may as well be a bandit hideout!

00:16:36.161 --> 00:16:40.064
Guess there won't be any big
welcome feast for us tonight.

00:16:40.132 --> 00:16:44.069
We're at war here,
and this IS Marmo territory.

00:16:44.136 --> 00:16:45.763
Don't be so quick to put us down!

00:16:45.838 --> 00:16:49.138
Really. You wanted to
come along, remember?

00:16:49.208 --> 00:16:51.905
You can always go back home
by yourself if you want.

00:16:52.277 --> 00:16:56.578
Huh? Sheesh, I guess the
elf princess is mad at me...

00:16:56.648 --> 00:16:59.242
...for getting in the way of her
having a romantic trip for two.

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:01.286
Maar...!

00:17:12.264 --> 00:17:13.060
Oh!

00:17:13.265 --> 00:17:14.926
Parn! Deed!

00:17:15.401 --> 00:17:16.766
It's been a while, Hobb.

00:17:16.835 --> 00:17:17.927
Are you well?

00:17:18.003 --> 00:17:21.530
Huh? I don't believe it!
Hobb, it's you!

00:17:21.607 --> 00:17:24.076
Maar? What are you doing here?

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:28.711
With Kanon trapped in
the dark shadow of Marmo...

00:17:28.781 --> 00:17:32.718
...the legendary free knight
Parn rises to save it!

00:17:33.652 --> 00:17:37.020
You can't ask for a better
beginning for a saga!

00:17:37.089 --> 00:17:38.784
Typical...

00:17:38.857 --> 00:17:42.293
I thought you were on a quest
to find true heroes, Hobb.

00:17:44.229 --> 00:17:47.859
And it led me back
to the same place.

00:17:47.933 --> 00:17:51.961
Now, get inside. Everyone's
been awaiting your return.

00:17:56.942 --> 00:18:00.071
Has there been any
movement since I left?

00:18:00.145 --> 00:18:05.549
The villages remain the same.
But there's been disturbing news.

00:18:05.617 --> 00:18:07.210
Disturbing news?

00:18:07.286 --> 00:18:09.983
The Marmo Council seems to have
decided the occupied territories...

00:18:10.055 --> 00:18:13.320
...shouldn't be ruled by Rabido as
his own personal dictatorship.

00:18:13.392 --> 00:18:16.726
It seems they'll be dispatching
a new governor very shortly.

00:18:18.764 --> 00:18:22.166
| doubt the peoples' anger
towards the Marmo will disappear...

00:18:22.234 --> 00:18:25.534
...just because they're sending
in a new governor, but still...

00:18:25.604 --> 00:18:29.632
But getting a new governor
changes the nature of the battle.

00:18:29.708 --> 00:18:33.508
Anyway, Prince Reona is waiting
to give you more details on this.

00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:35.570
Right. I understand.

00:18:37.683 --> 00:18:39.617
Prince Reona?

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:41.619
The leader of the free army.

00:18:41.687 --> 00:18:45.419
The rightful crown prince
of the kingdom of Kanon.

00:18:46.325 --> 00:18:52.128
That's great... A new hero
fighting for the future of Lodoss.

00:18:54.933 --> 00:18:57.868
My poet's blood is boiling!

00:19:19.458 --> 00:19:22.428
My treasures are beautiful no matter
how many times I look at them.

00:19:27.332 --> 00:19:29.596
Precious gems are
like fine food to me!

00:19:29.668 --> 00:19:34.162
This is why I never want to
stop being the governor here!

00:19:41.146 --> 00:19:44.241
Hey! Bring me some more wine!

00:20:24.056 --> 00:20:26.354
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:20:26.425 --> 00:20:28.860
And now, what you've been waiting
for, the second part of the show!

00:20:34.032 --> 00:20:36.865
Okay, to bring you all
up to date on things...

00:20:37.569 --> 00:20:40.231
We're STILL wandering
around in that dungeon...

00:20:40.706 --> 00:20:42.936
Wow, it's been a whole
week since last time.

00:20:43.008 --> 00:20:44.840
Spark has no sense of direction.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.540
Th- That's not fair!

00:20:48.447 --> 00:20:50.381
If I knew this was gonna happen,
I'd have stayed in Flaim...

00:20:50.449 --> 00:20:53.646
...and gone on dates with
all the hot babes there!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.886
This is no time to be
blowing your nose!

00:20:57.656 --> 00:20:59.181
Who are you?! Show yourself!

00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:01.124
COOL...dialogue at least...

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.360
Running away is really
embarrassing, Spark!

00:21:11.436 --> 00:21:13.063
That voice... Could it be...?

00:21:13.138 --> 00:21:14.299
Parn, the free knight?

00:21:14.373 --> 00:21:16.432
Bingo! You got it!

00:21:16.508 --> 00:21:19.808
I've been wandering around this
stupid place for a MONTH now!

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:25.512
We're starving!
Give us something to eat!

00:21:27.519 --> 00:21:29.920
Anyway, this is part
of being a knight.

00:21:29.988 --> 00:21:35.859
A knight can't ever lose his cool,
even when things are bad.

00:21:35.927 --> 00:21:38.521
You're not exactly convincing me...

00:21:38.597 --> 00:21:39.621
Still, I'm so happy!

00:21:39.698 --> 00:21:43.066
You were worried and came to see
if I was all right!

00:21:43.769 --> 00:21:45.294
Check it out!
There's a camera over there!

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:46.838
Lucky!

00:21:47.005 --> 00:21:49.906
I've tried to follow
all of your advice.

00:21:49.975 --> 00:21:53.206
Like, no matter what plan I try,
I shouldn't get careless.

00:21:53.278 --> 00:21:58.045
I'm going to complete this mission
and become a great knight!

00:22:00.752 --> 00:22:02.914
So, from now on,
I'll be...fighting for...

00:22:02.988 --> 00:22:05.855
Huh? Parn! Deed!
What are you doing?

00:22:06.558 --> 00:22:07.548
Hi there!

00:22:07.626 --> 00:22:12.427
I think they just want to get on
TV as much as possible now.

00:22:12.831 --> 00:22:14.731
Would you two cut it out?!

00:22:15.334 --> 00:22:17.200
This is OUR part of the series!

00:23:40.118 --> 00:23:43.748
The free army rises to save
Kanon and smash the Marmo!

00:23:43.822 --> 00:23:47.156
As we begin the battle,
the Black Knight...

00:23:47.225 --> 00:23:49.660
...we last saw at
Fire Dragon Mountain reappears...

00:23:49.728 --> 00:23:50.889
...with a new ambition!

00:23:50.962 --> 00:23:54.990
The man who wields the
cursed sword...Ashram!

00:23:55.066 --> 00:23:58.559
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:58.637 --> 00:24:00.935
"An Old Enemy...
Reunion With the Black Knight."
